ould%20like%20to%20get%20in%20touch%20about%20my%20vehicle." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="pointer-events-auto hidden min-h-[52px] min-w-[156px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border px-6 text-sm font-semibold shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.16)] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange lg:flex border-transparent bg-[#171819] text-white hover:bg-[#202122]">Contact Us</a></div></header><div class="h-[98px] lg:h-[126px]"></div><main><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li><a class="hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li><a class="hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/brands">Brands</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li><a class="hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/brands/mercedes-benz-service-dubai">Mercedes-Benz</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li class="text-off-white font-semibold">Transmission &amp; Gearbox Repair</li></ol></nav><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/[0.08] bg-[#101113]"><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20 lg:px-12 lg:py-24"><div class="max-w-4xl"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex h-14 w-20 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-white/[0.94] p-2 sm:h-16 sm:w-24"><img src="/brand-logos/showcase/mercedes-benz.png" alt="Mercedes-Benz logo" width="96" height="64" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-contain"/></div><span class="home-kicker">Mercedes-Benz Specialists</span></div><h1 class="mb-5 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(2.65rem,5vw,5.1rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.05em]">Mercedes Transmission &amp; Gearbox Repair in Dubai</h1><p class="mb-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/58 sm:text-lg">Jerking, slipping or delayed engagement is a diagnostic enquiry, even if a fluid service is also due. Digi-Tec checks the exact Mercedes gearbox, its service history and the conditions in which the fault occurs before proposing service or repair.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4"><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20enquire%20about%20Mercedes-Benz%20Transmission%20Repair%20at%20Digi-Tec%20Performance%20Centre." data-cta-placement="hero" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-5 h-5"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg>Request a Mercedes Gearbox Inspection</a><a href="tel:+97143402223" data-cta-placement="hero" class="btn-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone w-5 h-5"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>Call +971 4 340 2223</a></div><p class="flex items-center justify-start gap-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400 tracking-wide mt-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-burnt-orange shrink-0"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Contact us to discuss your vehicle and request an appointment</p><p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/45">Independent Mercedes workshop in Al Quoz · Established 2002 · XENTRY/Star diagnosis where compatible</p></div></div></section><nav aria-label="On this page" class="border-b border-white/10 bg-black"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl gap-2 overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3 sm:px-6"><a href="#service-symptoms" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/65 transition-colors hover:border-burnt-orange/50 hover:text-burnt-orange focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange">Symptoms</a><a href="#service-scope" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/65 transition-colors hover:border-burnt-orange/50 hover:text-burnt-orange focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange">Scope</a><a href="#service-process" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/65 transition-colors hover:border-burnt-orange/50 hover:text-burnt-orange focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange">Process</a><a href="#service-guides" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/65 transition-colors hover:border-burnt-orange/50 hover:text-burnt-orange focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange">Guides</a><a href="#service-faqs" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/65 transition-colors hover:border-burnt-orange/50 hover:text-burnt-orange focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange">FAQs</a><a href="#service-booking" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/65 transition-colors hover:border-burnt-orange/50 hover:text-burnt-orange focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange">Book</a></div></nav><section id="service-symptoms" class="scroll-mt-24 py-12 sm:py-16 bg-black border-t border-white/5"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black mb-6 sm:mb-8">When to Book <span class="text-burnt-orange">Mercedes-Benz<!-- --> <!-- -->Transmission &amp; Gearbox Repair</span></h2><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4"><div class="card-premium flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-burnt-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Harsh shifts or delayed engagement into drive or reverse</span></div><div class="card-premium flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-burnt-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Engine speed rises without matching acceleration</span></div><div class="card-premium flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-burnt-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Transmission warning or restricted gear selection</span></div><div class="card-premium flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-burnt-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Fluid leakage, unusual noise or repeat faults after a service</span></div></div></div></section><section id="service-scope" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-br from-charcoal/35 to-black py-12 sm:py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6"><p class="eyebrow mb-4">Vehicle-specific scope</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-black sm:text-4xl">Identify the gearbox before choosing the repair</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60 sm:text-base">7G-Tronic, 9G-Tronic and AMG transmission variants are not interchangeable. The VIN, fitted unit and service history determine fluid requirements, access to live data and any supported adaptation procedure.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><a class="card-premium group scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl p-5" href="/mercedes/problems/gearbox-jerking"><h3 class="font-bold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange">Jerking or harsh changes</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Describe the gear, speed, temperature and load at which the change occurs. Engine-running or driveline faults can imitate a gearbox complaint.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-burnt-orange">Understand jerking and delayed engagement<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="card-premium group scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl p-5" href="/mercedes/problems/transmission-slipping"><h3 class="font-bold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange">Slipping or engine speed rising without drive</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Report loss of drive and warning messages before arranging the visit. Repeatedly forcing acceleration to reproduce the symptom can worsen the situation.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-burnt-orange">Slipping symptoms and inspection guidance<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><article class="card-premium group scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange">Fluid leaks and service history</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Confirm the leak source, fluid condition and applicable schedule. A fluid change is due maintenance when specified; it is not a guaranteed repair for internal wear or control faults.</p></article><article class="card-premium group scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange">Control, mechatronic and mechanical findings</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Power supply, wiring, sensors, hydraulic operation and internal condition may require different tests. The estimate distinguishes supported component repair, further investigation and replacement.</p></article><article class="card-premium group scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange">Adaptations after agreed work</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Resets, coding or relearning are performed only where required by the completed repair and supported for the fitted gearbox. Clearing learned values is not a universal cure.</p></article><article class="card-premium group scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange">What a quote should explain</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Ask for the diagnosed concern, labour, fluid approval, parts route, exclusions and verification. A rebuild or replacement is not selected from a fault-code label alone.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-charcoal/40 to-black"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black mb-3">Mercedes-Benz<!-- --> models and fitted systems</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base mb-6 sm:mb-8">Workshop scope, compatible functions and parts are confirmed for the exact Mercedes-Benz model before booking.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3"><a class="card-premium group rounded-2xl p-3 text-center sm:p-4" href="/blog/mercedes-c-class-service-dubai-guide"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange sm:text-sm">C-Class</span></a><a class="card-premium group rounded-2xl p-3 text-center sm:p-4" href="/blog/mercedes-e-class-service-dubai-guide"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange sm:text-sm">E-Class</span></a><a class="card-premium group rounded-2xl p-3 text-center sm:p-4" href="/blog/mercedes-s-class-service-dubai-guide"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange sm:text-sm">S-Class</span></a><a class="card-premium group rounded-2xl p-3 text-center sm:p-4" href="/mercedes/models/gle-service-repair-dubai"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange sm:text-sm">GLE</span></a><a class="card-premium group rounded-2xl p-3 text-center sm:p-4" href="/mercedes/models/gls-service-repair-dubai"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange sm:text-sm">GLS</span></a><a class="card-premium group rounded-2xl p-3 text-center sm:p-4" href="/mercedes/models/g-class-service-repair-dubai"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-off-white group-hover:text-burnt-orange sm:text-sm">G-Class</span></a></div></div></section><section id="service-process" class="scroll-mt-24 py-12 sm:py-16 bg-black border-t border-white/5"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black mb-6 sm:mb-10">Our <span class="text-burnt-orange">Transmission &amp; Gearbox Repair</span> Process</h2><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="card-premium rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-burnt-orange text-black font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm">1</span><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-off-white">Identify 7G, 9G or the fitted AMG unit</h3></div><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pl-11">Use vehicle data to confirm the transmission variant, fluid requirement and supported diagnostic functions. AMG transmissions must not be treated as one interchangeable gearbox type.</p></div><div class="card-premium rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-burnt-orange text-black font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm">2</span><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-off-white">Separate service from diagnosis</h3></div><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pl-11">Review compatible fault data, leaks, fluid condition and level using the required procedure. Operating checks, where appropriate, help distinguish gearbox faults from engine, mount or driveline concerns.</p></div><div class="card-premium rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-burnt-orange text-black font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm">3</span><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-off-white">Agree the level of work</h3></div><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pl-11">Routine fluid/filter work, a control or valve-body repair, internal dismantling and unit replacement are different scopes. The estimate explains the supported option and any further investigation required.</p></div><div class="card-premium rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-burnt-orange text-black font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm">4</span><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-off-white">Verify the original symptoms</h3></div><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pl-11">After the agreed work, check leaks, operating behaviour and relevant fault data. Adaptation or programming is included only when required and supported for the fitted unit.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-charcoal/40 to-black border-t border-white/5"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 text-burnt-orange flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h2 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black mb-3"><span class="text-burnt-orange">Mercedes-Benz</span> Parts Options, Documented</h2><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">The estimate identifies the fluid approval and quantity, filter or sump components, seals, labour and any diagnostic or adaptation charges. A fluid change is not presented as a guaranteed cure for an existing shift fault.</p><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20enquire%20about%20Mercedes-Benz%20Transmission%20Repair%20at%20Digi-Tec%20Performance%20Centre." data-cta-placement="service_scope" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold text-burnt-orange hover:underline">Request a Mercedes Gearbox Inspection<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id="service-guides" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-white/5 bg-charcoal/15 py-12 sm:py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6"><p class="eyebrow mb-4">Model and owner guides</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-black sm:text-4xl">Understand the symptom before the repair</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Explore the relevant symptom, model or service scope to help describe the concern when you contact the workshop.</p><ul class="mt-7 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><li><a class="card-premium group flex h-full items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/blog/transmission-service-7g-9g-dubai"><span>7G and 9G transmission service guide</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="card-premium group flex h-full items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/mercedes/problems/gearbox-jerking"><span>Why a Mercedes gearbox jerks</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="card-premium group flex h-full items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/mercedes/problems/transmission-slipping"><span>How to recognise transmission slipping</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="card-premium group flex h-full items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/blog/mercedes-e-class-service-dubai-guide"><span>E-Class transmission considerations</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div></section><section id="service-faqs" class="scroll-mt-24 py-12 sm:py-16 bg-black border-t border-white/5"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10">Mercedes-Benz<!-- --> <!-- -->Transmission &amp; Gearbox Repair<!-- --> <span class="text-burnt-orange">FAQs</span></h2><div class="space-y-3" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl px-5 sm:px-6 data-[state=open]:border-burnt-orange/40"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R1ct8:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:Rct8:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-off-white font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg hover:no-underline py-5" data-radix-collection-item="">Will an oil change fix a jerking Mercedes gearbox?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R1ct8:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rct8:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pt-0 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pb-5">It depends on the cause. Fluid condition is one part of the assessment; control, internal wear, engine or driveline faults may require different work.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl px-5 sm:px-6 data-[state=open]:border-burnt-orange/40"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R1kt8:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:Rkt8:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-off-white font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg hover:no-underline py-5" data-radix-collection-item="">Do all Mercedes gearboxes use the same service interval?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R1kt8:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rkt8:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pt-0 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pb-5">No. The fitted transmission, vehicle schedule and history determine the due work and required fluid specification.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl px-5 sm:px-6 data-[state=open]:border-burnt-orange/40"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R1st8:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:Rst8:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-off-white font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg hover:no-underline py-5" data-radix-collection-item="">Can you quote repair or replacement before inspection?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R1st8:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rst8:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pt-0 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed pb-5">An initial enquiry can establish likely assessment steps. A repair or replacement recommendation needs the gearbox identified and the fault investigated.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-charcoal/40 to-black border-t border-white/5"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 sm:mb-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 text-burnt-orange"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black">More <span class="text-burnt-orange">Mercedes-